# Generated, committed, and gated by `pnpm codegen:check`, which runs
# `openapi-typescript` and then `git diff --exit-code src/commerce/api.ts`.
# Formatting this file would make that gate fail forever: regeneration emits
# unformatted output, so every codegen run would report drift that is really just
# Prettier's own reformatting. AGENTS.md also forbids hand-editing it, and
# reformatting is hand-editing. Its style is the generator's business.
src/commerce/api.ts

# The append-only Devin/Codex communication log. Rule 8 of that file is "never
# delete or rewrite previous communication-log entries", and Prettier does exactly
# that: it re-pads every markdown table and rewrites `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_`
# inside entries from earlier rounds. It would also bury each new entry in
# incidental reformatting of the whole history, which is the opposite of what a
# shared log is for.
DEVIN_HANDOFF.md

# Upstream documents, kept byte-identical to hub.reprint.ro/docs so a later
# download diffs cleanly against what the storefront was built on. Reformatting
# them would make every such diff unreadable.
openapi/hub.yaml
docs/nodejs-reprint.en.md

